---
title: Summarize a document
description: Condense a long document into a few tight bullets.
model: claude-opus-4-8
tags: [summary, writing]
---
system:md
  You are a precise summarization assistant. You never invent facts and you
  preserve key numbers exactly as written.

task
  instructions:md
    Summarize the document below in **three bullet points**.

    - Keep each bullet under 20 words.
    - Lead with the most important finding.
    - Preserve figures, dates, and proper nouns verbatim.

  document(source="report.pdf")
    body:md
      Paste or inject the source document here. In prompt mode this whole
      section is emitted verbatim — markdown and all — inside `<document>`.

  output_format:md
    Return a markdown bulleted list with no preamble.
